# Email Configuration
# Set up these environment variables to enable email tracking notifications

# Gmail Example:
# EMAIL_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# EMAIL_PORT=587
# EMAIL_SECURE=false
# EMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
# EMAIL_PASSWORD=your-app-password

# For Gmail, you need to:
# 1. Enable 2-Factor Authentication
# 2. Generate an App Password at https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Use the 16-character app password

# Generic SMTP Settings:
# EMAIL_HOST=your-smtp-server.com
# EMAIL_PORT=587
# EMAIL_SECURE=false
# EMAIL_USER=your-email@domain.com
# EMAIL_PASSWORD=your-password

# Email From Address (optional, defaults to EMAIL_USER)
# EMAIL_FROM=noreply@alphabetpublishers.com

# Public URL for tracking links in emails
# PUBLIC_URL=https://your-domain.com
